<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Semapa boosts H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Semapa boosts H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billion escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net profit (after minorities) 1.42  vs  0.77</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			   30.30  vs 28.57</p>
<p>    Cons cashflow (after minorities)   6.04</p>
<p>Note - Semapa-Sociedade de Investimento &amp; Gestao SGPS is the full name of the cement company.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the increase in profit had been achieve despite the negative impact of bad weather at the start of the year.</p>
<p>The result reflected improved productivity and lower costs as a result of declining interest rates.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
